---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHead from "../../components/PageHead.astro";
import CtaBand from "../../components/CtaBand.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="About | 7Captur"
  description="7Captur helps people who market a product or service understand what is working and decide what to do next, without pretending to know what the data cannot prove."
  path="/about/" current="/about/">
<main>
<PageHead wide title="Clear next steps, without pretending to know more than the data shows." lede="7Captur is a small, focused team building decision support for people who market a product or service." />

<section class="section section-flush" style="padding-bottom:72px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Most marketing tools show you numbers. Few help you decide what to do next, and fewer still are honest about what the numbers cannot prove. A post with thousands of likes may have sold nothing. A platform may report a sale that a refund later erases.</p>
      <p>7Captur starts from the data you actually have, whether that is a list of posts in a notebook or a connected store and ad account. It gives one clear next step, explains why, says what it does not know, and tells you what to record next.</p>
      <p>You make the decision. 7Captur does not change your ads, budgets or posts.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Principles</p>
    <h2>The rules that do not change with account size.</h2>
    <div class="principles">
      <div class="principle"><h3>Evidence first</h3><p>We match our advice to your evidence and label where every number came from.</p></div>
      <div class="principle"><h3>Honest about unknowns</h3><p>Missing data is called missing, never guessed as zero. We never promise results.</p></div>
      <div class="principle"><h3>Your control</h3><p>You decide whether to act. You can export or delete your data at any time. See the <a href="/security/">security page</a>.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<CtaBand title="See what your data says." text="Start free with whatever you have today." />
</main>
</Layout>
